  "body": "Full-audit correctness fix for fail-closed real-action auditing.\n\nThe NEXT_STEP audit coordinator re-resolved `offerPrice` from the bot's main configured step number. That can differ from the price actually prepared/submitted when adaptive pricing scales a step or when the negotiation belongs to an additional product with its own strategy.\n\nThe coordinator now receives the effective price directly from `decision.nextStep()` and records that value. This is especially important for AMBIGUOUS post-submit audits, where the audit record is the forensic source of truth. CONFIRMED backend auditing still independently derives its trusted final price from listing state.\n\nNo negotiation decision, submit, quota, action-guard or pricing policy behavior changes.",
  "created_at": "2026-09-18T19:08:32Z",
